{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo registration and redemption for orders and subscription upgrades. Both paths use one pricing helper to apply discounts before tax. Orders record the discounted subtotal, applied discount, and promo code.\n\nInvalid, unknown, stacked, expired, and below-minimum promos raise `ValidationError`. The expiry date itself is valid. Percentage discounts round half-up, and fixed discounts are capped at the subtotal. Upgrade replays return the original entry, while changing the promo code or date under the same idempotency key raises `ValidationError`.\n\nAdded seven promo tests. `python3 benchmarks/sources/ev1_order_ledger/run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 17 tests passing."}}
